{
    "background_story": "Lucca was a young monk who lived in a secluded monastery nestled in the rolling hills of Tuscany. He spent his days studying the ancient scriptures and tending to the beautiful gardens that surrounded the monastery. Lucca's devotion to his faith was unwavering, and he spent hours in contemplation, seeking guidance from a higher power. As he delved deeper into his spiritual journey, Lucca began to experience mystical visions and heard whispers of divine wisdom. His fellow monks looked up to him as a holy man, seeking his counsel and guidance. One day, a devastating drought struck the land, and the crops began to wither. Lucca prayed fervently, and soon, a miraculous rainstorm swept through the valley, restoring the fertility of the soil. The people of the nearby village hailed Lucca as a holy intercessor, and his reputation as a man of great faith spread far and wide.",
